{"2376410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bird's Eye Odyssey", "steam_appid": 2376410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376410/extras/009caa77b8d4c65b5c56c65a8203868e.webp?t=1680271594\" width=630 height=62 /></span><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376410/extras/76d2e820aa54112299806ad7ae2162a0.avif?t=1680271594\" width=610 height=150 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Bird's Eye Odyssey</h2><strong>Embark on a journey of self-discovery</strong> in this captivating 3D adventure game that follows the quest of a bird protagonist to uncover the truth about his banishment from his clan.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376410/extras/3a14a39b04c5faaccb31adedfbe1e3f3.webp?t=1680271594\" width=630 height=62 /></span><br><br><strong>Explore</strong> a lush world created by a solo developer using the <strong>Unreal Engine</strong>, with stunning graphics and <strong>immersive gameplay</strong>. As you complete tasks for the Totem, flashes of memories will begin to piece together the events that led to your exile. Along the way, you'll face challenges and obstacles that will test your resilience and determination.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376410/extras/b15d32fa8a5df7cf7907990022bf7aa2.webp?t=1680271594\" width=630 height=62 /></span><br><br>Collect rings and hidden objects, fly through rings to earn points and complete quests against the clock. Take a break and <strong>drive a tank,</strong> eat apples, or walk on two feet. The possibilities are endless in 